Meta.documentation:json
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The application/json Content-Type: parsed JSON data, and named records with
Meta.documentation:field-addressable I/O (the nesting pattern: like file: into a document).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:As a Content-Type (used by Dawn.cast and friends): parse bytes into Data
Meta.documentation:(in_octetstream_default_$all), emit the parsed value on go (out_Data_default).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:As an addressable record: json:environment is a record; references with the
Meta.documentation:same name share it within the process. Fields nest file-style:
Meta.documentation:json:environment.version addresses the "version" field as a source (emits its
Meta.documentation:value on go) — and a JSON document loaded through file: (foo.json) is meant to
Meta.documentation:expose the same surface, so foo.json:version / ?version become legal once the
Meta.documentation:extension-to-Content-Type tie lands (not yet implemented).
Meta.documentation:Sink side is a bind override: any offered out_<Type>_<field> becomes a writer
Meta.documentation:for that field (dots nest deeper). There are no return values in Dawn: the
Meta.documentation:record seals at end of input and streams as an httpServer reply
Meta.documentation:({__dawnResponse}, text/json) on out_response_default — wire json:rec>>httpServer:0
Meta.documentation:so the loop closes at the server it came from.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Caveat: named records are process-global; safe because httpServer serializes
Meta.documentation:request flows. Revisit before concurrent handlers. Bare json: (no name) is an
Meta.documentation:anonymous per-request record: reset at in_begin, sealed and streamed at in_end.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_octetstream_default_$all — parse bytes as JSON into the value
Meta.documentation:@port out_Data_default — the parsed value, fired on in_go
Meta.documentation:@port out_String_default — field source: a string field emitted on go
Meta.documentation:@port out_response_default — the sealed record reply, streamed at in_end
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@kind value
Meta.documentation:@status experimental

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20Content-Type%2Fapplication%2Fjson%20%E2%80%94%20parsed%20JSON%20data%20from%20bytes%20(Content-Type%0A%2F%2F%20role)%20AND%20named%20records%20with%20field-addressable%20I%2FO%20(nesting%20role%2C%20file%3A-like).%0A%2F%2F%20Records%20live%20in%20a%20module-level%20registry%20keyed%20by%20name%2C%20so%20all%20references%0A%2F%2F%20in%20a%20flow%20write%2Fread%20the%20same%20object.%20Sink%20side%20%3D%20bind%20override%20(any%0A%2F%2F%20offered%20out_%3CType%3E_%3Cfield%3E%20becomes%20a%20writer)%3B%20source%20side%20%3D%20file-style%0A%2F%2F%20nested%20addressing%20(json%3Aname.field.subfield%20as%20a%20flow%20head%20emits%20that%20value).%0Aconst%20records%20%3D%20%7B%7D%3B%0Aconst%20VALUE_TYPES%20%3D%20%5B%22String%22%2C%22Number%22%2C%22Boolean%22%2C%22Data%22%2C%22octetstream%22%5D%3B%0Afunction%20json()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22json%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%20%3D%20jsonProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20jsonProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09this.out_Data_default%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.out_String_default%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%0A%09this.in_instanciate%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20newObject%20%3D%20this.get_resource().clone()%3B%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20URI%20tail%3A%20%22%22%20(Content-Type%20use)%2C%20%22name%22%20(record)%20or%20%22name.field.sub%22%20(field)%0A%09%09const%20tail%20%3D%20((input%20%26%26%20input.value)%20%7C%7C%20%22%22).split(%22%3F%22)%5B0%5D.split(%22%23%22)%5B0%5D%3B%0A%09%09const%20dot%20%3D%20tail.indexOf(%22.%22)%3B%0A%09%09newObject.recordName%20%3D%20decodeURIComponent(dot%20%3D%3D%3D%20-1%20%3F%20tail%20%3A%20tail.slice(0%2C%20dot))%3B%0A%09%09newObject.fieldPath%20%20%3D%20dot%20%3D%3D%3D%20-1%20%3F%20null%20%3A%20decodeURIComponent(tail.slice(dot%2B1)).split(%22.%22)%3B%0A%09%09if%20(newObject.recordName%20%26%26%20!records%5BnewObject.recordName%5D)%20records%5BnewObject.recordName%5D%20%3D%20%7B%7D%3B%0A%09%09return%20newObject.instanciate_processor()%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20bare%20json%3A%20%3D%20anonymous%20per-request%20record%20on%20this%20processor%20instance%3B%0A%09%2F%2F%20json%3Aname%20%3D%20the%20named%20process-global%20record%0A%09let%20instanceRecord%20%3D%20%7B%7D%3B%0A%09function%20currentRecord()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09return%20resource.recordName%20%3F%20records%5Bresource.recordName%5D%20%3A%20instanceRecord%3B%0A%09%7D%0A%0A%09function%20dig()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20v%20%3D%20currentRecord()%3B%0A%09%09if%20(resource.fieldPath)%0A%09%09%09for%20(const%20k%20of%20resource.fieldPath)%20%7B%20if%20(v%20%3D%3D%20null)%20return%20undefined%3B%20v%20%3D%20v%5Bk%5D%3B%20%7D%0A%09%09return%20v%3B%0A%09%7D%0A%0A%09function%20setField(path%2C%20value)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09let%20obj%20%3D%20currentRecord()%3B%0A%09%09for%20(let%20i%20%3D%200%3B%20i%20%3C%20path.length%20-%201%3B%20i%2B%2B)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09if%20(typeof%20obj%5Bpath%5Bi%5D%5D%20!%3D%3D%20%22object%22%20%7C%7C%20obj%5Bpath%5Bi%5D%5D%20%3D%3D%3D%20null)%20obj%5Bpath%5Bi%5D%5D%20%3D%20%7B%7D%3B%0A%09%09%09obj%20%3D%20obj%5Bpath%5Bi%5D%5D%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09obj%5Bpath%5Bpath.length%20-%201%5D%5D%20%3D%20value%3B%0A%09%7D%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20the%20record%20as%20an%20httpServer%20verbatim%20reply%20payload%20(streamed%20on%20out_response_default)%0A%09function%20replyPayload()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09return%20%7B%20__dawnResponse%3A%20%7B%20status%3A%20200%2C%20contentType%3A%20%22text%2Fjson%22%2C%20body%3A%20JSON.stringify(currentRecord())%20%7D%20%7D%3B%0A%09%7D%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20bind%20override%3A%20any%20offered%20out_%3CType%3E_%3Cfield%3E%20becomes%20a%20writer%20for%20%3Cfield%3E%0A%09%2F%2F%20(dots%20nest%20deeper).%20Writes%20only%20set%20fields%20-%20no%20return%20values%20in%20Dawn%3B%20the%0A%09%2F%2F%20sealed%20record%20streams%20out%20on%20out_response_default%20at%20end%20of%20input.%0A%09const%20baseOffer%20%3D%20this.offer_connection.bind(this)%3B%0A%09this.offer_connection%20%3D%20function(match)%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09const%20ux%20%3D%20match.indexOf(%22_%22)%3B%0A%09%09if%20(ux%20!%3D%3D%20-1%20%26%26%20VALUE_TYPES.includes(match.slice(0%2C%20ux)))%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09const%20path%20%3D%20(resource.fieldPath%20%3F%20resource.fieldPath.join(%22.%22)%20%2B%20%22.%22%20%3A%20%22%22)%20%2B%20match.slice(ux%20%2B%201)%3B%0A%09%09%09return%20function(input)%0A%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09let%20v%20%3D%20input%20%26%26%20input.value%20!%3D%3D%20undefined%20%3F%20input.value%20%3A%20input%3B%0A%09%09%09%09if%20(v%20%26%26%20v.get_resource)%20v%20%3D%20v.get_resource().value%3B%0A%09%09%09%09setField(path.split(%22.%22)%2C%20v)%3B%0A%09%09%09%09dirty%20%3D%20true%3B%0A%09%09%09%7D%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09return%20baseOffer(match)%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09let%20dirty%20%3D%20false%3B%0A%09this.out_response_default%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09this.in_begin%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09dirty%20%3D%20false%3B%0A%09%09if%20(!resource.recordName)%20instanceRecord%20%3D%20%7B%7D%3B%20%2F%2F%20anonymous%20records%20are%20per-request%0A%09%09this.out_begin%3F.()%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%09this.in_end%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09if%20(dirty%20%26%26%20this.out_response_default)%0A%09%09%09this.out_response_default(%7B%20value%3A%20replyPayload()%20%7D)%3B%0A%09%09this.out_end%3F.()%3B%0A%09%7D%3B%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20Content-Type%20role%3A%20parse%20bytes%20into%20the%20value%0A%09this.in_octetstream_default_%24all%20%3D%20function(input)%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%09%09let%20u8%20%3D%20input.value%20instanceof%20Uint8Array%20%3F%20input.value%20%3A%20new%20Uint8Array(input.value)%3B%0A%09%09let%20text%20%3D%20new%20TextDecoder().decode(u8)%3B%0A%09%09try%20%7B%20resource.value%20%3D%20JSON.parse(text)%3B%20%7D%0A%09%09catch%20(e)%20%7B%20resource.value%20%3D%20text%3B%20%7D%0A%09%09%2F%2F%20a%20named%20record%20loaded%20from%20bytes%20becomes%20the%20record's%20content%0A%09%09if%20(resource.recordName%20%26%26%20typeof%20resource.value%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22object%22)%20records%5Bresource.recordName%5D%20%3D%20resource.value%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%0A%09%2F%2F%20go%3A%20field%20instances%20emit%20the%20addressed%20value%3B%20plain%20instances%20emit%20the%0A%09%2F%2F%20parsed%20Data%20(Content-Type%20role).%0A%09this.in_go%20%3D%20function()%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%09%09if%20(resource.fieldPath)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09const%20v%20%3D%20dig()%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(typeof%20v%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22string%22)%20return%20this.out_String_default%3F.(%7B%20value%3A%20v%20%7D)%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(v%20!%3D%3D%20undefined)%20return%20this.out_Data_default%3F.(%7B%20value%3A%20v%20%7D)%3B%0A%09%09%09return%20undefined%3B%0A%09%09%7D%0A%09%09return%20this.out_Data_default%3F.(resource)%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0Ajson.Processor%3DjsonProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%3Djson%3B]>>NewResource:application.json